      "satAct": {"status":"verified","items":["SAT or ACT required — all first-year applicants, domestic and international","Testing waiver available for applicants who face hardship in meeting the requirement","No minimum score"],"sources":[{"url":"https://admissions.upenn.edu/how-to-apply/preparing-your-application/testing","label":"Penn: Testing"}],"lastVerified":"2026-10-19","sourceSnippet":"Penn applicants are required to submit scores for the SAT or ACT. Applicants who face hardship in meeting this requirement can submit a waiver instead. This applies to all first-year, domestic, international, homeschooled, transfer, and QuestBridge applicants. … There is no minimum score required to apply to Penn."},
